ck\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->2 min</span></div><h1>AliExpress Choice Day Avril 2026 : Jusqu&#x27;a -60% + 9 Codes Promo + Reduction PayPal</h1><p class=\"article-subtitle\">AliExpress Choice Day avril 2026 : jusqu&#x27;a -60%, 9 codes promo CDFR02 a CDFR55, reduction PayPal jusqu&#x27;a 33 euros. Vente du 01 au 07 avril.</p><div class=\"article-rating-bar\"><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les promos AliExpress<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"article-hero-image\" style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;max-height:450px\"><img alt=\"AliExpress Choice Day codes promo avril 2026\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;max-height:450px\" src=\"/images/articles/aliexpress-promo-anniversaire-mars-2026.svg\"/></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface, #fefce8);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0\"><form style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--primary)\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-right:8px\">Recevez les bons plans par email</span><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Votre email\" required=\"\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb);font-size:0.9rem\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--primary);color:white;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem\">OK</button></form></div><div class=\"article-content\"><div><p>\n# AliExpress Choice Day : jusqu'a -60% + codes promo</p><p>Le <strong>Choice Day AliExpress</strong> est en cours jusqu'au <strong>7 avril 2026 a 23h59</strong>. Le theme : <strong>En plein air</strong>. Jusqu'a <strong>-60%</strong> sur une selection + <strong>9 codes promo</strong> + reductions <strong>PayPal</strong> jusqu'a 33 euros. Derniers jours pour en profiter.</p><hr><h2>Codes Promo AliExpress (01/04 - 07/04)</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Code</th><th>Reduction</th><th>Minimum d'achat</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR02</strong></td>\n<td>2 euros</td>\n<td>15 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR04</strong></td>\n<td>4 euros</td>\n<td>29 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR07</strong></td>\n<td>7 euros</td>\n<td>49 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR09</strong></td>\n<td>9 euros</td>\n<td>69 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR13</strong></td>\n<td>13 euros</td>\n<td>99 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR20</strong></td>\n<td>20 euros</td>\n<td>159 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR25</strong></td>\n<td>25 euros</td>\n<td>209 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR40</strong></td>\n<td>40 euros</td>\n<td>329 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR55</strong></td>\n<td>55 euros</td>\n<td>459 euros</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>Les codes sont valables sur les articles selectionnes jusqu'au 7 avril 23h59 (heure de Paris).</p><hr><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les promos AliExpress <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Reduction PayPal x AliExpress</h2><p>En plus des codes promo, une <strong>offre PayPal</strong> est disponible :</p><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Reduction</th><th>Minimum d'achat</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>20 euros</strong></td>\n<td>199 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>33 euros</strong></td>\n<td>299 euros</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>Les reductions PayPal se cumulent avec les codes promo — c'est la combinaison gagnante pour maximiser les economies.</p><hr><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Comment maximiser les reductions</h2><p>La strategie est simple : <strong>code promo + reduction PayPal + prix Choice Day</strong>. Par exemple, sur un panier de 299 euros :\n<ul><li>Prix deja en promo (jusqu'a -60%)</li>\n<li>Code <strong>CDFR25</strong> = -25 euros</li>\n<li>PayPal = -33 euros</li>\n<li>Total economise : jusqu'a <strong>-60% + 58 euros de reductions supplementaires</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr></p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les promos AliExpress <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Notre avis</h2><p>Le Choice Day est l'un des meilleurs evenements AliExpress apres l'anniversaire de mars. Les codes CDFR sont genereux et le cumul avec PayPal est un vrai plus. Le theme \"En plein air\" tombe bien pour preparer l'ete : mobilier de jardin, sport, camping, velos, trottinettes... Attention, la vente se termine le <strong>7 avril a 23h59</strong>, il ne reste plus beaucoup de temps.\n</p></div></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:40px 0;padding:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%);border-radius:16px;border:2px solid #FECDD3\"><p style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--foreground)\">Profiter de cette offre</p><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" style=\"padding:14px 32px;font-size:1rem\">Voir les promos AliExpress<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></article><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><section class=\"related-articles\"><h2>A lire aussi</h2><div class=\"articles-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))\"><a href=\"/article/dr-pierre-ricaud-codes-promo-offres-avril-2026\" class=\"card\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:160px;overflow:hidden\"><img alt=\"Dr Pierre Ricaud codes promo et offres avril 2026\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-fit:cover;color:transparent\" src=\"/images/articles/dr-pierre-ricaud-codes-promo-offres-avril-2026.svg\"/></div><div class=\"card-body\"><span style=\"font-size:0.72rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--primary);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px\"> </span><h3 class=\"card-title\">Dr Pierre Ricaud : Codes Promo et Offres Avril 2026 (Jusqu&#x27;a -40%, Codes PAQUES10, AVRIL10, SOIN10)</h3><p class=\"card-excerpt\">Toutes les offres Dr Pierre Ricaud avril 2026 : Creme Glow -40%, Lifting Cou -30%, 2 achetes 1 offert, codes promo PAQUES10 (10€ offerts), AVRIL10 et SOIN10 (-10%).</p></div></a><a href=\"/article/code-promo-miin-cosmetics-newmiin10-10-euros-beaute-coreenne-2026\" class=\"card\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:160px;overflow:hidden\"><img alt=\"Code promo MiiN Cosmetics NEWMIIN10 beaute coreenne\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom: