\":\"article-subtitle\",\"children\":\"AliExpress Choice Day avril 2026 : jusqu'a -60%, 9 codes promo CDFR02 a CDFR55, reduction PayPal jusqu'a 33 euros. Vente du 01 au 07 avril.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-rating-bar\",\"children\":[\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored noopener\",\"children\":[\"Voir les promos AliExpress\",\" \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":13,\"height\":13,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-external-link\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}]]}],\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"]}],\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\"]}]}],\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\"]\n1e:I[5500,[\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/6e48aeeec84550f8.js\"],\"Image\"]\n1f:I[96788,[\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/6e48aeeec84550f8.js\"],\"default\"]\n20:I[1586,[\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/6e48aeeec84550f8.js\"],\"default\"]\n22:I[67277,[\"/_next/static/chunks/cf200c391baea40a.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/6e48aeeec84550f8.js\"],\"default\"]\nf:[\"$\",\"path\",\"1q9fwt\",{\"d\":\"M15 3h6v6\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"path\",\"gplh6r\",{\"d\":\"M10 14 21 3\"}]\n11:[\"$\",\"path\",\"a6xqqp\",{\"d\":\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"}]\n12:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-hero-image\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"#fff\",\"borderRadius\":\"12px\",\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"alignItems\":\"center\",\"maxHeight\":\"450px\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/articles/aliexpress-promo-anniversaire-mars-2026.svg\",\"alt\":\"AliExpress Choice Day codes promo avril 2026\",\"width\":800,\"height\":450,\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"100%\",\"objectFit\":\"contain\",\"maxHeight\":\"450px\"},\"priority\":true}]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\n14:[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{}]\n21:Tf62,<p>\n# AliExpress Choice Day : jusqu'a -60% + codes promo</p><p>Le <strong>Choice Day AliExpress</strong> est en cours jusqu'au <strong>7 avril 2026 a 23h59</strong>. Le theme : <strong>En plein air</strong>. Jusqu'a <strong>-60%</strong> sur une selection + <strong>9 codes promo</strong> + reductions <strong>PayPal</strong> jusqu'a 33 euros. Derniers jours pour en profiter.</p><hr><h2>Codes Promo AliExpress (01/04 - 07/04)</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Code</th><th>Reduction</th><th>Minimum d'achat</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR02</strong></td>\n<td>2 euros</td>\n<td>15 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR04</strong></td>\n<td>4 euros</td>\n<td>29 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR07</strong></td>\n<td>7 euros</td>\n<td>49 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR09</strong></td>\n<td>9 euros</td>\n<td>69 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR13</strong></td>\n<td>13 euros</td>\n<td>99 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR20</strong></td>\n<td>20 euros</td>\n<td>159 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR25</strong></td>\n<td>25 euros</td>\n<td>209 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR40</strong></td>\n<td>40 euros</td>\n<td>329 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CDFR55</strong></td>\n<td>55 euros</td>\n<td>459 euros</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>Les codes sont valables sur les articles selectionnes jusqu'au 7 avril 23h59 (heure de Paris).</p><hr><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les promos AliExpress <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Reduction PayPal x AliExpress</h2><p>En plus des codes promo, une <strong>offre PayPal</strong> est disponible :</p><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Reduction</th><th>Minimum d'achat</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>20 euros</strong></td>\n<td>199 euros</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>33 euros</strong></td>\n<td>299 euros</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>Les reductions PayPal se cumulent avec les codes promo — c'est la combinaison gagnante pour maximiser les economies.</p><hr><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Comment maximiser les reductions</h2><p>La strategie est simple : <strong>code promo + reduction PayPal + prix Choice Day</strong>. Par exemple, sur un panier de 299 euros :\n<ul><li>Prix deja en promo (jusqu'a -60%)</li>\n<li>Code <strong>CDFR25</strong> = -25 euros</li>\n<li>PayPal = -33 euros</li>\n<li>Total economise : jusqu'a <strong>-60% + 58 euros de reductions supplementaires</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr></p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les promos AliExpress <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Notre avis</h2><p>Le Choice Day est l'un des meilleurs evenements AliExpress apres l'anniversaire de mars. Les codes CDFR sont genereux et le cumul avec PayPal est un vrai plus. Le theme \"En plein air\" tombe bien pour preparer l'ete : mobilier de jardin, sport, camping, velos, trottinettes... Attention, la vente se termine le <strong>7 avril a 23h59</strong>, il ne reste plus beaucoup de temps.\n</p>15:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$21\"}}]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\n17:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"margin\":\"40px 0\",\"padding\":\"32px\",\"background\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%)\",\"borderRadius\":\"16px\",\"border\":\"2px solid #FECDD3\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":800,\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"var(--foreground)\"},\"children\":\"Profiter de cette offre\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://tidd.ly/4mdabjv\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored noopener\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"14px 32px\",\"fontSize\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":[\"Voir les promos AliExpress\",\" \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":15,\"height\":15,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-external-link\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1q9fwt\",{\"d\":\"M15 3h6v6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"gplh6r\",{\"d\":\"M10 14 21 3\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"a6xqqp\",{\"d\":\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\n19:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"related-articles\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"A lire aussi\"}],